menu "MusicPanel Board"

    choice BSP_BOARD
        prompt "Target board"
        default BSP_BOARD_ESP32_4848S040
        help
            Selects the physical panel MusicPanel is built for. Only the
            selected board's driver code is compiled. To add a new panel,
            create components/bsp/boards/<name>/ and add a choice entry here —
            no code outside components/bsp should ever need to change.

        config BSP_BOARD_ESP32_4848S040
            bool "Guition/JCZN ESP32-4848S040 (4.0\" 480x480, ST7701S + GT911)"

    endchoice

endmenu
